WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.401
-My first guest
is a great actress.

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:04.170
You can see her as Wonder Woman
in the new movie

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.005
"Wonder Woman 1984."

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:09.375
It's in select theaters
and IMAX on Christmas Day

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:12.512
and will also be available
the same day on HBO Max.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.881
Here is Gal Gadot!
Gal!

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:17.317
Oh, my goodness.
It's so good to --

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:19.719
-We're hugging you from here.
-I'm hugging you from here, too.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.489
Oh, pal, it's so great
to see you.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:25.325
Thank you so much
for coming back to our show.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.827
Can you believe
"Wonder Woman 1984"

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.896
is finally here?
It's here, it's happening.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:32.165
-I can and I can't
at the same time.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.900
We've been waiting
for such a long time

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.502
to be able to share this
with the world

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:37.836
and now is the moment.

00:00:37.836 --> 00:00:41.907
And it's so surreal
that we're releasing the movie,

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:45.144
and I don't get to see you.
Like, everything is virtual.

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:47.013
The world had gone crazy.
-I know, but it's a great --

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:50.250
-I'm super excited.
-I want to say that this movie

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.685
has more action
than the first one.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.387
Did you know that going into it
that you're gonna be like,

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:57.423
"I'm going to be exhausted
in this one"?

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.025
-Yes, I did.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.794
Patty made a big point about

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:04.431
wanting to have
minimum amount of CGI,

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.466
which is great,
and I love the idea.

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:10.469
I just didn't really understood
what it meant for me,

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:13.272
and what it did mean
was that we just --

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:18.845
you know, both Kristen, too,
and I had to do so much --

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:20.846
so much stunt work by ourselves.

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:22.248
-I want to show you one thing
that I noticed

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.616
when I watched it.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:26.185
There was one kick that you did
that I want to say --

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:28.921
-Oh, that.
-Your body was like --

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.623
You were parall--
-The front kick --

00:01:31.623 --> 00:01:33.893
The front kick layout.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:36.162
-The front kick layout
is what it's called?

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.098
-It's horizontal and --
-Were you on wires?

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.400
-That was assisted majorly,

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.704
and that was also my stunt girl,
who's, like, amazing.

00:01:45.704 --> 00:01:47.206
-I asked the studio
for this clip

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:48.307
'cause I just wanted
to watch it.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:49.609
Do you mind
if I watch this kick?

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.777
Dave, could we watch this?
-Sure.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.778
-Yeah, let's watch it.
-Look at this.

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:54.814
Stop right there.
Look at that.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:56.582
Look at that!
Perfection!

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:57.616
-[ Laughing ]

00:01:57.616 --> 00:01:59.151
-That is unbelievable!

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:02.355
-And holding the gun
and the lasso.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.690
-And the lasso.
I mean, look at that.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:08.327
That's the poster right there.
Come on.

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:11.196
I also remember
seeing something.

00:02:11.196 --> 00:02:15.868
I thought it was you flying in
the invisible jet or something.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.202
I thought that was a spoiler
or something,

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:20.039
'cause it looked like you were
sitting in the street.

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:22.908
-I know, I know.

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:25.879
That was not the invisible jet.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:29.215
That was me being in major pain.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.118
We shut down Penn Avenue
in Washington, D.C.,

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:35.221
for a few days,
and I had to do, like,

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:40.526
this intense running,
and I was wired, like,

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:44.430
from here and from here,
and they pulled me

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.935
in the same speed as Usain Bolt
ran when he won

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.336
one of his medals.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.971
-He's the fastest man
in the world.

00:02:52.971 --> 00:02:55.608
-Yeah, I know.
So we had to --

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.243
So that's what we did.
-So that was you --

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.912
Oh, so you needed --
'Cause you're actually running

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:01.880
and the wires are pulling you.
-But the craziest thing is

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:05.451
that you got to make sure
that every stride,

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.387
you hit the floor
so it does look like

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:10.423
you're running.
-Yeah, I auditioned,

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.892
and, yeah, I didn't --
They actually didn't even

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.459
call me back at all,
but whatever.

00:03:14.459 --> 00:03:16.195
A little rude, but...

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:20.233
I will say our pal Kristen Wiig
crushes it in this movie.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:22.068
She's also in the movie.
-Crushes it.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:25.037
We actually adore each other
so much.

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:28.074
We had a crazy
instant connection.

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:31.043
It was like she --
Because the movie was so

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:33.612
laborious and they were so --

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:35.781
It was very long.
We shot the movie

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:39.118
for eight months
in five different locations,

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:42.188
and it was just, like,
super physical, as well.

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:44.723
The fact that
she was there with me,

00:03:44.723 --> 00:03:48.361
doing these crazy things
but also, like, being her,

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:51.197
she's, like, the most --
She's so --

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:53.632
You know, but she's like --
I'll tell everyone else.

00:03:53.632 --> 00:03:56.536
Guys, you're missing on
not knowing Kristen Wiig.

00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:59.605
-[ Laughing ]
-She's, like, fun and funny

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:02.875
and open, and, like,
she made this experience

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:07.246
so, so delightful for me,
and I'm super grateful.

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:09.882
-We know that you guys
became fast friends

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:12.018
and really good friends
on the set,

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.552
and this is very, very cool.

00:04:13.552 --> 00:04:15.421
You guys sent us
one of your music videos.

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:18.825
You made a music video together.
It's very low-budget.

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:21.827
Here is an exclusive
world premiere of Gal Gadot

00:04:21.827 --> 00:04:24.730
and Kristen Wiig's music video.
Take a look.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:30.435
[ Rhythmic clapping ]

00:04:30.435 --> 00:04:33.105
-♪ Gal and Krissy having fun ♪

00:04:33.105 --> 00:04:36.209
♪ We're Gal and Krissy,
and we're having fun ♪

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:39.178
-♪ Sometimes we run
and jump in the air ♪

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:42.214
-♪ Sometimes we stare
and then flip our hair ♪

00:04:42.214 --> 00:04:45.084
-♪ We are friends,
and we like science ♪

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:48.020
-♪ We feel comfortable
in total silence ♪

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.522
[ Insects chirping ]

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:50.890
-♪ Come on, everybody ♪

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.124
-♪ Dance in the sun ♪

00:04:52.124 --> 00:04:54.893
♪ 'Cause we're Gal and Krissy ♪

00:04:54.893 --> 00:04:57.830
♪ And we're having fun ♪

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.164
[ Both laugh ]
-I love you!

00:04:59.164 --> 00:05:00.867
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:00.867 --> 00:05:02.067
-Oh, my God!

00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:04.904
[ Children cheering ]
-Oh, my God!

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:08.174
It's the fake applause
at the end, and the kids.

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:09.809
It is honestly --
-Oh, my God.

00:05:09.809 --> 00:05:11.811
-♪ And we're having fun ♪

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:14.246
♪ Gal and Krissy,
and we're having fun ♪

00:05:14.246 --> 00:05:18.084
Dude, that's catchy.
-The claps and everything.

00:05:18.084 --> 00:05:19.952
-That was the funniest thing.

00:05:19.952 --> 00:05:23.489
Can you tell everyone what's
going on in "Wonder Woman 1984"?

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:26.559
-Oh, my God.
Um...

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:31.063
Wow. Where do I begin without
giving away too many spoilers?

00:05:31.063 --> 00:05:32.531
What I can tell you is,

00:05:32.531 --> 00:05:36.769
it's the most ambitious movie
I've ever got to make.

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:40.673
As far as storytelling, we have
four different storylines.

00:05:40.673 --> 00:05:43.041
As far as the action goes,
like we talked about,

00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:45.177
there's so much action,
for real.

00:05:45.177 --> 00:05:49.048
As far as location
and the scope, it's huge.

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:52.618
And I'm very, very excited
to share it with everybody.

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:56.555
And I hope that people
are going to enjoy it

00:05:56.555 --> 00:05:59.492
and have a wonderful
2 1/2 hours watching it.

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:01.360
-We need it right now
more than ever.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.563
I want to show everyone
a clip from the film.

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:06.699
Here's Gal Gadot
in "Wonder Woman 1984."

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:07.767
Take a look.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:17.510
♪♪

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.545
-Well, aren't you resourceful.

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:21.880
-Come with me.
-No, I don't think so.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.717
Remove this woman, please --
permanently.

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:27.220
[ Gunshots ]

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.087
-Aah!

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:31.657
[ Both grunting ]

00:06:31.657 --> 00:06:35.227
Ow.
-Are you okay?

00:06:35.227 --> 00:06:36.762
-I am now.

00:06:36.762 --> 00:06:40.265
♪♪

00:06:40.265 --> 00:06:41.433
[ Grunts ]

00:06:41.433 --> 00:06:44.971
♪♪

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:47.806
-Unh!

00:06:47.806 --> 00:06:51.377
-"Wonder Woman 1984" will be
in select theaters and IMAX

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:53.812
on Christmas Day
and will be available

00:06:53.812 --> 00:06:55.915
the same day on HBO Max.

